## :radio: 1520 Sedgwick Avenue

- 11 August 1973: [Clive Campbell](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DJ_Kool_Herc), DJ Kool Herc, 18, plays a back-to-school party in the rec room of a Sedgwick Avenue building
- Two copies of a record, the break played twice: [hip hop](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hip_hop) begins
- Bambaataa, Flash, the Cold Crush Brothers; by 1979 it was on vinyl and gone to the world

> The building still stands, a block from the Major Deegan. The city co-named the street Hip Hop Boulevard in 2023, fifty years on.

---

